---
import LegalPage from '../components/page/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  path="/privacy/"
  description="How AadiVed Yoga and Wellness collects and uses the information you share through this website."
  intro="How AadiVed handles the information you share with us on this website."
>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: [Date to confirm]</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>{site.name} is a yoga and sound healing studio at {site.address.street}, {site.address.locality}, {site.address.postalCode}. You can reach us on <a href={`tel:${site.phone.tel}`}>{site.phone.display}</a>.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We only collect what you choose to send us.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Enquiry form:</strong> your name, phone number, email address (optional), the practice and format you are interested in, your preferred time and your message.</li>
    <li><strong>Newsletter sign-up:</strong> your email address.</li>
    <li><strong>Phone and Instagram:</strong> whatever you tell us when you call or message us.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your enquiry and arrange a session.</li>
    <li>To send class updates and simple practices, only if you signed up for the newsletter.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your information.</p>

  <h2>Who handles it</h2>
  <p>This website is hosted on Cloudflare. Enquiries and newsletter sign-ups are handled by a form provider: [Form provider to confirm].</p>

  <h2>Google Maps and other services</h2>
  <p>We do not load Google Maps when you visit a page. It loads only after you click &#8220;Load map&#8221;, and then Google may receive information about your visit under its own policies. The links to Google, Instagram and WhatsApp take you to those services, which have their own privacy policies.</p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>[To confirm: whether any analytics or cookies are used on this website]</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to show, correct or delete the information we hold about you, or stop our emails at any time. Call <a href={`tel:${site.phone.tel}`}>{site.phone.display}</a> or message us on <a href={site.instagram.dm}>Instagram</a>.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change this policy, we will update this page and the date above.</p>
</LegalPage>
